** Consult-omni

Multi-source search: ripgrep, notes, Wikipedia, and web results in one completing-read.

#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(use-package consult-omni
  :ensure (:host github
           :repo "armindarvish/consult-omni"
           :files (:defaults "sources/*.el"))
  :after consult
  :custom
  (consult-omni-show-preview t)
  (consult-omni-preview-key "C-o")
  :config
  (require 'consult-omni-sources)
  (require 'consult-omni-embark)
  (setq consult-omni-sources-modules-to-load
        '(consult-omni-google
          consult-omni-wikipedia
          consult-omni-ripgrep
          consult-omni-notes))
  (consult-omni-sources-load-modules)
  (setq consult-omni-default-interactive-command #'consult-omni-multi))
#+end_src

** Ghostel

[[https://github.com/dakra/ghostel][Ghostel]] is a terminal emulator using Ghostty's VT engine as a native module. Supports OSC 8 hyperlinks and Kitty keyboard protocol. The native module is downloaded on first use when prompted.

#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(use-package ghostel
  :ensure (:host github :repo "dakra/ghostel")
  :commands (ghostel ghostel-other)
  :custom
  (ghostel-module-auto-install 'ask)
  (ghostel-max-scrollback 10000)
  (ghostel-kill-buffer-on-exit t))
#+end_src

