** Flycheck

On-the-fly syntax checking. Requires external linters (=luacheck= for Lua, =python-pylint= for Python). Enable per-buffer with =SPC t f=.

#+begin_src emacs-lisp
;; Flycheck is opt-in for this writing-first config.
;; Enable per buffer with SPC t f, or add prog-mode to the hook below
;; if you want it active in all programming buffers automatically.
(use-package flycheck
  :ensure t
  :commands flycheck-mode
  :diminish)
#+end_src

