* Post Hooks
:PROPERTIES:
:header-args:emacs-lisp: :tangle ~/.emacs.d/post-init.el
:END:

Standard built-in modes that minimal-emacs.d exposes but leaves off by default. Activated via =after-init-hook= so they run once Emacs is fully loaded.

#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(add-hook 'after-init-hook #'global-auto-revert-mode) ; Sync buffers with disk
(add-hook 'after-init-hook #'recentf-mode)            ; Track recently opened files
(add-hook 'after-init-hook #'savehist-mode)           ; Persist minibuffer history
(add-hook 'after-init-hook #'save-place-mode)         ; Remember cursor position
#+end_src

